      "originalText": "EXTERNAL\n\nAny Google account\nOnly option for @gmail.com devs\n\nTwo states:\nTesting → max 100 test users, \"unverified app\" warning, token expires 7 days\nProduction → open to all, needs Google verification for sensitive/restricted scopes",
