      "updated": 1787736844455,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "7. Configure HashiCorp Boundary SSO\nBelow are the configuration steps to complete the OAuth/OIDC federation setup:\n\n--> Sign into the HashiCorp Boundary Cluster ( https://0df56b42-1dcf-4236-8b0d-abaaf4c53353.boundary.hashicorp.cloud/ )\n--> Create Organization & Under Organization \n       --> Go to Auth methods and select New, select OIDC.",
      "fontSize": 109.04066680382644,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "7. Configure HashiCorp Boundary SSO\nBelow are the configuration steps to complete the OAuth/OIDC federation setup:\n\n--> Sign into the HashiCorp Boundary Cluster ( https://0df56b42-1dcf-4236-8b0d-abaaf4c53353.boundary.hashicorp.cloud/ )\n--> Create Organization & Under Organization \n       --> Go to Auth methods and select New, select OIDC.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "labelPosition": null
